      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "IPs are not expected to be private information. Steam Networking is a peer-to-peer realtime networking service in use by many applications, including VRChat. If you want to keep your IP truly safe, we encourage the use of a VPN. We are investigating alternatives, but our recommendation stands for the moment.",
